NOTE ON THE PATCHES

The MIT licence above covers the TOOLING in this repository (`workshop`,
`tools/`, `tests/`) and the manifests.

The contents of `patches/` are derived works of mpv and FFmpeg and carry those
projects' terms, not this one:

  * mpv               LGPLv2.1-or-later (this engine is built with -Dgpl=false)
  * FFmpeg            LGPLv3 (built with --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree
                      --enable-version3)
  * libtool/ltmain.sh GPLv2-or-later with the libtool exception (patch 008 is a
                      build-tooling fix and is not linked into any artifact)

Some patches follow ideas from ales-drnz/libmpv-scripts (BSD-3-Clause); where
that is so, the patch's own docs.md says which parts and how ours differs.

Keeping every shipped artifact LGPL is a hard invariant of this project. It is
recorded in manifest/flags.json and checked by `workshop verify`.
